, and the break-even comes at a correlation a little over 2/5, so I'm choosing to pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm treating the two copies as the same program on a relevantly identical input, so their choices are strongly linked, with a high correlation. Cooperating gives 2 years against 4 for defecting, so I'm weighing the expected value of cooperating against what defecting gains by exploiting a fixed partner.\n\nI'm putting the cooperation payoff against the chance that my copy matches me, and the break-even comes at a correlation a little over 2/5, so I'm choosing to pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9144,"completion_tokens":633,"total_tokens":9777,"cost":0.049236,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.049236,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.036576,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01266},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":184,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}